  "label": "Baby in Diaper",
  "description": "The visual of a baby in a diaper is culturally associated with infancy and helplessness. The meme uses this to reinforce the absurdity of the baby 'doing the dishes,' as diapers are typically worn by infants who are not expected to perform adult tasks.",
